From 4573aa60a42cf7116b99136c5e708a9ee7aa172c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Nakya <nakya@Mac-mini-di-Nakya.local>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 21:56:14 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 4/4] feat: cards and resolve for Auto Review approvals and
 email drafts

cards <bot> lists the cards waiting on you; resolve answers one with the app's
own action: Allow once / Deny through resolveAutoReviewApproval, Discard through
discardDraft. It re-reads the card first and refuses decisions the card doesn't
offer, always-allow, takeovers and settled cards; drafts are never sent.
office-watch streams the cards and how recent ones ended.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
